Apply 2 apps: create shop/cache, change shop/web.
Touches 2 apps on 2 nodes (node-a, node-b); replaces 3 instances, starts 1 instance (the scheduler places them when it applies).
Serves https://shop.example.com/ and the service web.shop.
Undo: `relish undo 17` puts every app back as it was and deletes cache, which it created.
